<view class="notifications-page">
  <view class="header">
    <image class="back-icon" src="/assets/profile-icons/arrowleft-dark.png" mode="aspectFit" bindtap="goBack" />
    <text class="header-title">通知设置</text>
  </view>

  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-icon"><image class="hero-icon-img" src="/assets/profile-icons/bell-primary.png" mode="aspectFit" /></view>
    <text class="hero-title">通知与提醒</text>
    <text class="hero-subtitle">NOTIFICATION SETTINGS</text>
  </view>

  <view class="settings-card">
    <view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="key" class="setting-item">
      <view class="setting-icon"><image class="setting-icon-img" src="/assets/profile-icons/bell-primary.png" mode="aspectFit" /></view>
      <view class="setting-info">
        <text class="setting-title">{{item.title}}</text>
        <text class="setting-desc">{{item.desc}}</text>
      </view>
      <switch data-key="{{item.key}}" checked="{{item.checked}}" color="#E89F71" bindchange="setSwitch" />
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="footer-note">
    <text>关闭推送通知后，你仍可在消息中心查看消息。每日问候和时光信件提醒仅在小程序打开时生效。</text>
  </view>
</view>
